## solution

#### using a hashmap (object)

```js
const pairSum = (numbers, targetSum) => {
  const previousNums = {};
  for (let i = 0; i < numbers.length; i += 1) {
    const num = numbers[i];
    const complement = targetSum - num;
    if (complement in previousNums) return [i, previousNums[complement]];

    previousNums[num] = i;
  }
};
```

- n = length of array
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

